# What this application's image is built from, beside the estate's own pins
# (scripts/versions.env). The fabricator passes every line here to the build
# as an argument of the same name.

# The Valheim dedicated server build, as Steam numbers it. Recorded by the
# expediter when Valve publishes one: its pull request changes this line and
# nothing else, which is all its standing order covers. The fabricator builds
# the image from it and the release that production runs.
VALHEIM_STEAM_BUILD_VERSION=25730807
